---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import LegalLayout from '../components/LegalLayout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy — Preston East Solutions"
  description="How Preston East Solutions LLC collects, uses, and protects information from prospects, clients, and website visitors."
>
  <PageHeader label="Legal" title="Privacy Policy" />
  <LegalLayout lastUpdated="June 2026">
    <p>
      This Privacy Policy describes how <strong>Preston East Solutions LLC</strong>
      (“Preston East,” “we,” “us,” or “our”) collects, uses, and shares
      information from visitors and clients of
      <a href="https://prestoneastsolutions.com">prestoneastsolutions.com</a>
      and the services we provide.
    </p>

    <h2>1. Information we collect</h2>
    <h3>You give us</h3>
    <p>When you fill out a form, book a Health Check, email, or call, you may
    share name, work email, phone, company, employee count, and a description
    of your IT issue. Active engagements may require additional information
    needed to deliver the work.</p>
    <h3>Automatic data</h3>
    <p>We collect standard server logs (IP address, user agent, referrer,
    pages visited) and analytics events (page views, anonymized session
    metadata) via Google Analytics and Vercel Analytics. We do not use these
    to identify individuals.</p>

    <h2>2. How we use it</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To respond to inquiries, schedule calls, and deliver Health Check reports.</li>
      <li>To provide, manage, and improve our services for active clients.</li>
      <li>To send transactional communications (booking confirmations, reminders, deliverables).</li>
      <li>To monitor site performance and improve content.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We do not sell personal information. We do not run third-party
    advertising trackers as of this update.</p>

    <h2>3. How we share it</h2>
    <p>We share information only with vendors that help us operate the
    business — for example, our hosting provider (Vercel), CRM
    (GoHighLevel), and analytics tools (Google Analytics, Vercel Analytics).
    Each operates under their own privacy terms.</p>
    <p>We may disclose information when required by law or to protect rights,
    property, or safety.</p>

    <h2>4. Data retention</h2>
    <p>We retain inquiry data for up to 24 months unless you request earlier
    deletion. Active client records are retained for the duration of the
    engagement plus any period required by tax, accounting, or contract law.</p>

    <h2>5. Your choices</h2>
    <p>You can request a copy of your data, ask us to correct it, or ask us
    to delete it by emailing
    <a href="mailto:info@prestoneastsolutions.com">info@prestoneastsolutions.com</a>.
    You can also opt out of non-transactional emails at any time using the
    unsubscribe link in any message.</p>

    <h2>6. Security</h2>
    <p>We follow security best practices — encryption in transit, principle of
    least privilege on internal systems, and regular review of vendor access.
    No system is perfectly secure; if we ever discover a breach affecting
    your data, we will notify you in accordance with applicable law.</p>

    <h2>7. Children</h2>
    <p>Our services are intended for businesses. We do not knowingly collect
    information from anyone under 16.</p>

    <h2>8. Changes</h2>
    <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Material changes will be
    posted here with a revised “Last updated” date.</p>

    <h2>9. Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions? Email
    <a href="mailto:info@prestoneastsolutions.com">info@prestoneastsolutions.com</a>
    or write to Preston East Solutions LLC, 1125 West St, Ste 200 #335,
    Annapolis, MD 21401.</p>
  </LegalLayout>
</Layout>
